{"id":"word:hebrew:H779","type":"word","title":"אָרַר","subtitle":"H779 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to execrate","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אָרַר (H779) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 63 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אָרַר (ʼârar) means to execrate First listed occurrence: 1Sam 14 24."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אָרַר","transliteration":"ʼârar","pronunciation":"aw-rar'","strong":"H779","lemmaId":"hebrew:H779","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["אָר֣וּר","אָר֕וּר","אָר֥וּר","אָר֗וּר","אָר֤וּר"],"morphs":[["HVqsmsa",31],["HTd/Vprmpa",6],["HC/Vqsmsa",4],["HVqsmpa",3],["HVqi2ms",3],["HVqv2mp",2],["HVqv2ms/Sh",2],["HTd/Vqsfsa",1],["HVqsfsa",1],["HVpp3ms/Sp3fs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to execrate","usage":"× bitterly curse.","full":"H779. arar [ אָרַר ] verb curse (Assyrian arâru Zim BP 68 ; on relation of meanings bind & curse in Assyrian see Dl Pr 101 ) — Qal Perfect אָרוֺתִיהָ וְאָרוֺתִ֫י, Mal 2:2 ; Imperfect 2masculine singular תָּאֹר Exod 22:27 ; Num 22:6 , 12 ; אָאֹר Gen 12:3 ; Imperative אָ֫רָהֿ Num 22:6 ; 23:7 ; אֹרוּ אוֺרוּ, & Infinitive absolute אָרוֺר all Judg 5:23 ; Participle אֹרֲרֵי Job 3:8 ; אֹרֲרֶיךָ Gen 27:29 ; Num 24:9 ; אָרוּר Gen 3:14 36t. etc.; — curse || בֵּרֵךְ bless , chiefly in poetic & legal sources of J E D & later imitations: 12:3 ; 27:29 (J) Num 22:6 , 12 ; 23:7 ; 24:9 (E) Exod 22:27 (E) Mal 2:2 ; ישְׁבֶיהָ אָרוֺר אֹרוּ = curse for ever her inhabitants Judg 5:23 ; יוֺם אֹרֲרֵי cursers of the day (magicians whose imprecations made days unlucky) Job 3:8 . Passive participle אָרוּר , chiefly as exclamation, || בָּרוּךְ Gen 3:14 , 17 ; 4:11 ; 9:25 ; 27:29 ; 49:7 ; Num 22:12 ; 24:9 (E, poetry) Deut 27:15-26 Judg 21:18 ; 1Sam 14:24 ; 14:28 ; 1 Samuel 26:29; Jer 11:3 ; 17:5 ; 20:14-15 , 48:10 (twice in verse); Mal 1:14 ; מִמִּצְוֺתֶיךָ הַשֹּׁגִים אֲרוּרִים cursed be those who wander from thy commands Psa 119:21 ( ᵑ6 ᵐ5 Jerome De Ri), הַזּאֹת הָאֲרוּרָה this cursed woman 2Kin 9:34 . Niph`al Participle נֵאָרִים cursed Mal 3:9 . Pi`el 3masculine singular suffix אֵרֲרָהּ curse, lay under a curse Gen 5:29 (J); Participle הַמְאָרֲרִים הַמַּיִם the curse-bringing waters Num 5:18-27 (P 6 t. waters destroying the perjured adulteress drinking them). Hoph`al Imperfect יוּאָ֑ר be cursed Num 22:6 (E).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 14 24","keyReferences":["1Sam 14 24","1Sam 14 28","1Sam 26 19","2Kgs 9 34","Deut 27 15","Deut 27 16","Deut 27 17","Deut 27 18"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":63,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 14 24","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָר֣וּר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 28","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָר֥וּר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 26 19","book":"1Sam","chapter":26,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרוּרִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmpa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 34","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/אֲרוּרָ֤ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqsfsa"},{"reference":"Deut 27 15","book":"Deut","chapter":27,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָר֣וּר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 27 16","book":"Deut","chapter":27,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָר֕וּר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 27 17","book":"Deut","chapter":27,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָר֕וּר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 27 18","book":"Deut","chapter":27,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָר֕וּר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqsmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 27 19","book":"Deut","chapter":27,"verse":19,"english